WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.050
Your Windows PC just got an island.

00:00:02.331 --> 00:00:04.281
It's free, and it's called .light.

00:00:05.238 --> 00:00:09.128
Hover over it to see what's playing,
and skip songs without leaving your app.

00:00:10.071 --> 00:00:11.921
It remembers everything you copy.

00:00:12.197 --> 00:00:15.027
Links, colours and file paths
come with quick actions.

00:00:16.138 --> 00:00:20.508
Grab text from anything on your screen, or
copy a picture of it, with one shortcut.

00:00:21.671 --> 00:00:23.181
Save the prompts you use most.

00:00:23.452 --> 00:00:25.542
One click pastes them into your last app.

00:00:26.504 --> 00:00:31.034
Drop files on the island to hold them,
then drag them out wherever you need them.

00:00:31.904 --> 00:00:33.054
Here's the good part.

00:00:33.305 --> 00:00:36.275
When Claude Code needs your OK,
the island tells you.

00:00:36.401 --> 00:00:38.291
And it shows you when the job is done.

00:00:39.204 --> 00:00:43.314
A focus timer drains across the island,
and your notes are one tap away.

00:00:44.304 --> 00:00:45.094
.light.

00:00:45.385 --> 00:00:47.355
Free and open source, for Windows.

